---
/** Intelligence & AIOps — modern bento-style band */
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-ink/[0.06] bg-gradient-to-b from-cream via-cream to-warm-sand/55 py-16 md:py-24"
  aria-labelledby="aiops-module-heading"
>
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_120%_80%_at_100%_-20%,rgb(166_31_31_/_0.06),transparent_50%)]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-32 bottom-0 h-[420px] w-[420px] rounded-full bg-taupe/25 blur-3xl"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute right-[10%] top-[40%] h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-brand/[0.04] blur-[100px]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 md:px-8">
    <!-- Intro -->
    <header class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-2xl text-center md:mx-0 md:mb-14 md:max-w-[34rem] md:text-left">
      <p
        class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-accent/55 bg-accent/20 px-4 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-brand md:text-xs md:tracking-[0.26em]"
      >
        Intelligence & AIOps
      </p>
      <h2
        id="aiops-module-heading"
        class="mt-5 font-serif-display text-[clamp(2rem,4vw+0.5rem,3.25rem)] font-bold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink"
      >
        The differentiator
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-lg md:leading-relaxed">
        World’s leading consultancies are leading with AIOps. We make it concrete: models and automation wired into how
        your infrastructure is observed, scaled and healed — not slideware bolted on after the fact.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-stretch lg:gap-8">
      <!-- Feature stack -->
      <div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:col-span-7 lg:grid-cols-1 lg:gap-5 xl:col-span-7">
        <article
          class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/70 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/90 to-warm-sand/40 p-6 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.04),0_24px_48px_-28px_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.12)] ring-1 ring-ink/[0.04] backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:border-brand/15 hover:shadow-[0_28px_56px_-24px_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.14)] md:p-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-6"
        >
          <span
            class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-1 w-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-brand transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></span>
          <div
            class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/20 text-brand ring-1 ring-accent/30 lg:mb-0"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" d="M4 18V6m0 12 4-4m-4 4-4-4m12 8V10m0 8 4-4m-4 4-4-4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/40">01</p>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-2xl">Predictive scaling</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-[0.9375rem] md:leading-relaxed">
              Forecast demand and seasonality instead of chasing dashboards after load spikes. Right-size capacity ahead of
              traffic so you pay for what you need — not panic-provisioned headroom.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article
          class="group relative flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/70 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/90 to-warm-sand/40 p-6 shadow-[0_1px_0_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.04),0_24px_48px_-28px_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.12)] ring-1 ring-ink/[0.04] backdrop-blur-sm transition hover:border-brand/15 hover:shadow-[0_28px_56px_-24px_rgb(24_19_17_/_0.14)] md:p-7 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-6"
        >
          <span
            class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-1 w-full origin-left scale-x-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-accent to-brand transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-x-100"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></span>
          <div
            class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-accent/20 text-brand ring-1 ring-accent/30 lg:mb-0"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                d="M9.813 15.904 9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.847a4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.847.813a4.5 4.5 0 0 0-3.09 3.09ZM18.259 8.715 18 9.75l-.259-1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.455-2.456L14.25 6l1.036-.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.455-2.456L18 2.25l.259 1.035a3.375 3.375 0 0 0 2.456 2.456L21.75 6l-1.035.259a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-2.456 2.456Z"
              />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ink/40">02</p>
            <h3 class="mt-1 font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-2xl">
              Autonomous remediation
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-muted md:text-[0.9375rem] md:leading-relaxed">
              Guardrailed automation and runbooks address around <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">80%</strong> of common
              incidents — disk pressure, restarts, stuck deployments, noisy dependencies — before paging a human. Your team
              reviews patterns, not every alert.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <!-- Savings tracker -->
      <aside
        class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-brand/35 bg-brand-deep text-cream shadow-[0_32px_72px_-22px_rgb(166_31_31_/_0.55)] ring-1 ring-brand/20 lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-5"
        aria-labelledby="savings-tracker-title"
      >
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(155deg,#4a0f0f_0%,#5c1212_18%,#7a1616_42%,#a61f1f_72%,#6e1414_100%)]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 top-0 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-brand/50 blur-[90px]" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-16 bottom-[-20%] h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#c94a4a]/35 blur-[80px]"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-0 h-40 w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-[#2a0a0a]/80 via-brand-deep/20 to-transparent"
          aria-hidden="true"
        ></div>

        <div class="relative flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 md:p-8">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p id="savings-tracker-title" class="font-serif-display text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-2xl">
                Live savings tracker
              </p>
              <p class="mt-2 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-cream/65">
                Illustrative blend across engagements — refined as we close optimization cycles on AWS and Azure estates.
              </p>
            </div>
            <span
              class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-accent/55 bg-accent/15 px-3 py-1.5 text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-cream"
            >
              <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2" aria-hidden="true">
                <span class="absolute inline-flex h-full w-full animate-soft-pulse rounded-full bg-emerald-400/80 opacity-75"></span>
                <span class="relative inline-flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              </span>
              Aggregate
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- Decorative mini bars -->
          <div class="mt-6 flex h-10 items-end justify-end gap-1 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 35%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 55%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 40%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 70%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 45%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 90%"></span>
            <span class="w-1 rounded-sm bg-cream/90" style="height: 60%"></span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-auto rounded-2xl border border-cream/20 bg-[#1a0606]/35 p-5 backdrop-blur-sm md:p-6">
            <p class="text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cream/55">Typical cloud spend reduction</p>
            <div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-serif-display text-5xl font-bold tabular-nums tracking-tight md:text-[3.5rem]">35%</span>
              <span class="text-sm font-medium text-cream/80">AWS / Azure</span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-cream/60">First 90 days · workload-dependent</p>

            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-[0.65rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-cream/45">
                <span>Baseline</span>
                <span>Run-rate</span>
              </div>
              <div class="h-2.5 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-black/25 ring-1 ring-cream/15">
                <div
                  class="h-full w-[35%] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-accent via-[#ffd4d4] to-brand shadow-[0_0_24px_rgb(255_200_92_/_0.35)]"
                ></div>
              </div>
              <p class="text-[0.7rem] leading-snug text-cream/55">Example cohort view — not a guarantee for any single account.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
